sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Directory as Directory Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant Consumer as EmployeeConsumer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Match as MatchingEngine
    participant Projection as EffectiveRoleProjection
    participant Redis as Redis

    Directory->>Kafka: employee.updated
    Kafka->>Consumer: Event

    Consumer->>DB: Update Employee Reference
    Consumer->>Match: evaluate changed employee

    Match->>DB: Find User Groups dependent on changed attributes
    DB-->>Match: Candidate Groups

    Match->>Match: Evaluate Matching Criteria

    alt Newly matches
        Match->>DB: Insert membership
        Match->>Projection: recompute employee access
        Projection->>DB: Persist effective Roles
        Projection->>Redis: Update user authorization cache
    else Membership unchanged
        Match-->>Consumer: No authorization change
    end
